From 5ceb13ca701215a8a7aa862865060e5b3124c8d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rickow <30348240+Rickow@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:33:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] HSFA: sfa3umhsfa driver, Street Fighter Alpha 3 Upper MAX

Upper built with the SFA3 MAX characters (build option MAX=1) gets its
own driver and archive, sfa3umhsfa.zip, so that it can live next to
Upper (sfa3uhsfa) with separate save states, configuration and NVRAM.

- Same members, mechanisms and options as sfa3uhsfa (mode 2: graphics
  banks, plane bases, hybrid sound, ADX streams, DIPs, 0010-0012):
  HsfaUpperInit, HsfaDIPInfo. Translated program and HSFA data looked
  up by name (CRC not checked), like the other HSFA drivers.
- Optional member hsfa_trous.bin (patch 0009: data served in the free
  holes of the 68K map), as for sfa3hahsfa.
- No parent: nothing is ever read from sfa3uhsfa.zip.
- Title "Street Fighter Alpha 3 Upper MAX (HSFA)" (", 16:9" in the
  widescreen core).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/burn/drv/capcom/d_cps2.cpp | 54 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/burn/drv/capcom/d_cps2.cpp b/src/burn/drv/capcom/d_cps2.cpp
index 8a29ea2..ec187d6 100644
